      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I chose to go with Seam Electrical as I found Mark to be very knowledgeable and honest in his approach. He was the only installer that offered to do a site visit before I made a commitment so I could make an informed decision and obtain an accurate quote. He was not pushy at all. I have absolutely made the right decision in choosing Seam Electrical.Mark was awesome, explained all the different options and types of inverters and made sure I understood. He was very easy to work with and has excellent communication skills. There was a delay with the supply of the inverter, however I was advised of this beforehand. The scheduled installation would go ahead and the inverter would be installed once supplied. This did not bother me as have no reason to doubt his word.The installation went smoothly and efficiently. Mark and his team take pride in their work. They were punctual, professional and clean. The panels look great.The inverter is being installed soon and the inspection has already been organised. Mark will take care of the grid connection as well. It has been a very easy process.It has been a pleasure dealing with Seam Electrical and I have no hesitation in recommending them.",
